WEBVTT

00:20.970 --> 00:21.810
<b>This place...</b>

00:22.480 --> 00:26.310
<b>The XM here is different. Universal.
Not like anything I've felt before.</b>

00:31.150 --> 00:31.990
<b>It’s Sarah.</b>

00:40.330 --> 00:41.160
<b>You okay?</b>

00:42.580 --> 00:47.880
<b>The flesh is temporary, the soul eternal.
Don’t worry, we’ll meet again.</b>

00:49.880 --> 00:52.260
<b>What the... What is happening?!</b>

00:56.470 --> 00:57.300
<b>Jack?</b>

00:58.010 --> 00:59.800
<b>We never learned how to prevent Recursion.</b>

01:03.180 --> 01:05.310
<b>Perhaps that’s not even possible.</b>

01:06.190 --> 01:07.020
<b>Liu!</b>

01:13.400 --> 01:14.240
<b>Sarah!</b>

01:21.830 --> 01:25.750
<b>Brandt bought you a little time,
but now it’s running out.</b>

01:26.460 --> 01:29.500
<b>Time really is the cruelest master.</b>

01:29.580 --> 01:30.750
<b>The hell’s that mean?</b>

01:30.840 --> 01:32.840
<b>The game’s over. Time’s up.</b>

01:41.470 --> 01:42.310
<b>Jack!</b>

01:43.060 --> 01:43.890
<b>Damn.</b>

01:44.680 --> 01:45.520
<b>Alright, Jack.</b>

01:46.430 --> 01:48.900
<b>Time for me to tell you
a favorite bedtime story.</b>

01:49.520 --> 01:54.570
<b>A story about your friend Brandt
and his deal with the devil.</b>

01:55.320 --> 02:00.370
<b>Once upon a time you saved Brandt
and paid a great price.</b>

02:00.700 --> 02:03.990
<b>You were mortally wounded.
Recovery was impossible.</b>

02:05.370 --> 02:11.170
<b>But Brandt saw the impossible in Dark XM.
It was madness. And fascinating.</b>

02:12.000 --> 02:14.630
<b>You were reborn in Dark XM.</b>

02:17.470 --> 02:20.180
<b>A Simulacrum.</b>

02:20.800 --> 02:24.430
<b>A new kind of life
with a new kind of death.</b>

02:24.510 --> 02:28.100
<b>Now pay close attention, Jack.
This next part is important</b>

02:31.350 --> 02:34.360
<b>Trust me, you want to see what’s in here.</b>

03:07.930 --> 03:10.770
<b>Those crystals aren’t the only use
for Dark XM.</b>

03:11.600 --> 03:14.560
<b>Under the right circumstances,
Dark XM could cause</b>

03:14.650 --> 03:17.280
<b>someone who has died to recurse.</b>

03:18.360 --> 03:23.450
<b>The Dark XM forms a new being
that carries the mind, body and soul.</b>

03:25.490 --> 03:28.540
<b>So the Azmati legend was really true?</b>

03:29.700 --> 03:32.750
<b>You are a Simulacrum now, Jack.</b>

03:33.630 --> 03:37.550
<b>An imitation moulded from Dark XM.</b>

03:38.670 --> 03:40.130
<b>No longer human.</b>

03:43.220 --> 03:47.850
<b><i>Something is very wrong.</i>
<i>Time is running out, Agent.</i></b>

05:44.420 --> 05:45.470
<b>It’s working.</b>

05:47.010 --> 05:50.930
<b>This was a mistake.
Jeopardizing our work for a guard.</b>

05:51.430 --> 05:53.970
<b>They’re going to demand
your head for this.</b>

05:56.980 --> 06:00.310
<b>They can have it.
They're a step on my path.</b>

06:10.870 --> 06:16.000
<b>The success of your Recursion
was a godsend for Hulong.</b>

06:17.290 --> 06:21.420
<b>It taught us how to work with Dark XM
in new ways.</b>

06:21.500 --> 06:24.840
<b>Contain it in crystalline form.</b>

06:24.920 --> 06:28.170
<b>A powerful set of tools
for a powerful vision of the future.</b>

06:29.550 --> 06:32.050
<b>No, Jack! Are you OK?</b>

06:33.720 --> 06:36.310
<b>Anyway, that’s the story
of how a stupid guard</b>

06:36.390 --> 06:40.440
<b>and his impulsive boss
gave us the world.</b>

06:41.980 --> 06:45.610
<b>You said a “new kind of death.”
What did you mean?</b>

06:46.320 --> 06:51.110
<b>A Dark XM Simulacrum lasts 1331 days.</b>

06:52.530 --> 06:56.080
<b>Your story is almost over now, Jack.</b>

06:57.540 --> 07:00.330
<b>Your current simulacrum
has reached its end.</b>

07:02.710 --> 07:05.840
<b>We’ll find a way to stop it.
And to stop you.</b>

07:06.590 --> 07:09.880
<b>What if I said that there was a way?
To save him, I mean.</b>

07:10.760 --> 07:14.970
<b>He’ll lose his memories,
but a new Recursion is possible.</b>

07:15.640 --> 07:18.640
<b>As long as his human body
remains in this chamber.</b>

07:19.180 --> 07:22.940
<b>He won’t remember you, Sarah,
or anything after Brandt’s explosion.</b>

07:23.600 --> 07:25.610
<b>But he will continue living on.</b>

07:26.400 --> 07:28.230
<b>So let’s make a deal.</b>

07:28.320 --> 07:31.360
<b>Pledge absolute loyalty to me
and I will save him.</b>

07:31.740 --> 07:37.620
<b>We don’t have to be enemies.
I could make use of someone like you.</b>

07:38.200 --> 07:40.040
<b>You want me on your side?</b>

07:40.790 --> 07:43.710
<b>What makes you so sure
I won’t stab you in the back!</b>

07:44.080 --> 07:46.540
<b>You won’t betray me because you’re smart.</b>

07:46.630 --> 07:49.710
<b>And you know that you have
no other option.</b>

07:50.470 --> 07:54.180
<b>It will become apparent, in due time,
all we have in common.</b>

07:54.260 --> 07:56.470
<b>You’ll see the future just like I do.</b>

07:57.310 --> 07:59.680
<b>For what we share is powerful.</b>

08:01.980 --> 08:06.400
<b>Our abilities have blessed us with power
and cursed us with pain.</b>

08:06.480 --> 08:10.400
<b>We’ve suffered isolation and confusion.
We deserve so much more.</b>

08:11.360 --> 08:13.860
<b>So that’s what the Collaborators want?</b>

08:13.950 --> 08:16.820
<b>No. It’s what I want. For all of us.</b>

08:17.530 --> 08:19.830
<b>They use us like everything else.</b>

08:20.410 --> 08:24.500
<b>We’re nothing but steps
on their path to profit.</b>

08:24.870 --> 08:28.880
<b>They are short-sighted and greedy.
Cowardly and pathetic.</b>

08:29.630 --> 08:31.090
<b>All that will change.</b>

08:32.090 --> 08:35.340
<b>And soon...
I have a plan to take over their empire.</b>

08:36.180 --> 08:37.470
<b>But I can’t do it alone.</b>

08:37.550 --> 08:43.520
<b>I need people like you.
My people. Sensitives.</b>

08:43.940 --> 08:47.940
<b>If I agree, you promise
not to harm Jack or Sarah?</b>

08:48.520 --> 08:49.480
<b>That’s right.</b>

08:50.940 --> 08:54.280
<b>You drive a hard bargain. That said...</b>

08:55.030 --> 08:57.990
<b>You were right about me being smart.</b>

08:58.740 --> 09:01.740
<b>You know just as well as I do
that you’re not looking for allies.</b>

09:03.540 --> 09:06.620
<b>You’re looking for slaves.
People to carry you to your throne.</b>

09:07.210 --> 09:09.210
<b>You’re no different
from the Collaborators!</b>

09:09.290 --> 09:10.710
<b>I don’t need your mind.</b>

09:10.960 --> 09:12.590
<b>Just your obedience.</b>

09:13.670 --> 09:16.430
<b>If I destroy him
he’ll never Recurse again.</b>

09:16.880 --> 09:18.640
<b>Oppose me and he’ll simply disappear.</b>

09:21.350 --> 09:22.520
<b>Come on...</b>

09:22.970 --> 09:25.390
<b>There’s gotta be another way!</b>

09:26.190 --> 09:27.020
<b>No.</b>

09:30.400 --> 09:31.570
<b>Not your call.</b>

09:32.190 --> 09:35.280
<b>Brandt never liked you, Liu.</b>

09:35.820 --> 09:38.570
<b>The last thing he’d want
is to help you play god.</b>

09:39.030 --> 09:43.580
<b>Christopher Brandt is dead.
His short-sighted ideals died with him.</b>

09:43.950 --> 09:46.040
<b>Not as long as I’m still around.</b>

09:47.830 --> 09:49.040
<b>We can solve that.</b>

09:54.380 --> 09:55.210
<b>Jack...</b>

10:03.600 --> 10:05.470
<b>We got this. Let’s go.</b>

10:26.660 --> 10:28.830
<b>There are no secrets from me, Jack.</b>

10:43.930 --> 10:45.140
<b>-Are you okay?
-Yeah.</b>

10:45.560 --> 10:46.640
<b>But there's a problem.</b>

10:47.020 --> 10:49.980
<b>Somehow, he knows what I’m about to do
even before I do.</b>

10:51.940 --> 10:53.440
<b>He said “no secrets.”</b>

10:54.690 --> 10:55.940
<b>He’s a damn mindreader!</b>

11:02.910 --> 11:04.370
<b>Are you ready, Sensitives?</b>

11:08.290 --> 11:11.620
<b>You’ve never faced anyone
with abilities like mine.</b>

11:16.460 --> 11:18.380
<b>Every thought and every impulse.</b>

11:26.390 --> 11:29.680
<b>Your fears, loves and secrets...
I see every one.</b>

11:30.140 --> 11:30.980
<b>Bastard!</b>

11:34.110 --> 11:34.980
<b>Come on, Makoto.</b>

11:35.060 --> 11:37.440
<b>You must see the writing on the wall here.</b>

11:40.950 --> 11:43.910
<b>We may all be Sensitives,
but we’re not equals.</b>

11:43.990 --> 11:45.200
<b>You don't have a chance.</b>

12:00.130 --> 12:02.510
<b>This place again...</b>

12:03.090 --> 12:06.930
<b>That’s right.
I hope It’ll feel like home soon.</b>

12:08.260 --> 12:13.140
<b>There’s nothing like the peace
and power that exist here.</b>

12:13.980 --> 12:17.730
<b>You and I alone are Sensitive enough,</b>

12:18.150 --> 12:20.940
<b>for our psyches
to touch this Substrate.</b>

12:22.610 --> 12:24.320
<b>Christopher Brandt?</b>

12:24.910 --> 12:25.740
<b>You’re alive!</b>

12:26.320 --> 12:32.620
<b>Life and death don’t mean much here.
Only mind. Consciousness. Idea.</b>

12:34.040 --> 12:36.750
<b>Past. Present. Future.</b>

12:37.250 --> 12:40.460
<b>This place holds a part of everyone
who will ever touch a Portal.</b>

12:41.300 --> 12:43.880
<b>I’ve watched you from here
for a long time.</b>

12:44.930 --> 12:46.140
<b>I need to help my friends.</b>

12:46.220 --> 12:50.260
<b>Then you must reach out to them.
Find them through the Substrate.</b>

12:51.100 --> 12:55.940
<b>The Portals are all connected
in this place of infinite possibility.</b>

12:58.230 --> 12:59.360
<b>It is at your fingertips...</b>

13:00.270 --> 13:03.490
<b>Every part of this network.</b>

13:04.280 --> 13:05.110
<b>Makoto.</b>

13:16.670 --> 13:19.040
<b>This isn’t working.
I’ll draw his fire my way.</b>

13:30.300 --> 13:31.350
<b>Down!</b>

13:45.570 --> 13:46.820
<b>Makoto!</b>

13:55.450 --> 13:57.370
<b>Makoto! Jack!</b>

13:58.580 --> 14:00.330
<b>Can’t you help me save them somehow?</b>

14:00.880 --> 14:04.090
<b>You have yet to learn the implications
of your own powers.</b>

14:05.920 --> 14:08.970
<b>Seeing through the Portals.</b>

14:09.050 --> 14:11.430
<b>Communicating through them.</b>

14:11.970 --> 14:14.680
<b>Children’s toys compared to
what you will achieve.</b>

14:15.470 --> 14:17.390
<b>You have to discover yourself.</b>

14:18.190 --> 14:20.980
<b>When we first met,
something awoke inside you.</b>

14:23.070 --> 14:24.780
<b>It’s time for you to summon it.</b>

14:39.120 --> 14:40.750
<b>Have you had enough?</b>

14:50.720 --> 14:51.720
<b>Sarah?</b>

15:17.200 --> 15:18.040
<b>Sarah!</b>

15:19.460 --> 15:22.460
<b>-What have you done?
-Jack!</b>

15:43.440 --> 15:44.270
<b>Sarah!</b>

15:48.900 --> 15:52.490
<b>Sarah. Are you all right?</b>

15:59.370 --> 16:01.830
<b>Not really. Are you okay?</b>

16:04.080 --> 16:04.920
<b>Sarah?</b>

16:21.730 --> 16:24.940
<b>You guys sure... took your time!</b>

16:28.940 --> 16:31.400
<b>Hiya, Ai Kuzina here.</b>

16:32.240 --> 16:34.410
<b>Hulong’s new "Hulong Goggles"
launch today!</b>

16:34.490 --> 16:38.410
<b>Lines at the Hulong store are so long!</b>

16:41.200 --> 16:43.750
<b>So these visors are a trap?</b>

16:44.000 --> 16:47.750
<b>Yeah. Set up by the Collaborators.
Mind control on a global scale.</b>

16:48.380 --> 16:49.750
<b>How do we stop them?</b>

16:50.340 --> 16:51.260
<b>We’ve got a plan.</b>

16:51.590 --> 16:54.170
<b>Yeah. ADA is helping us.</b>

16:54.260 --> 16:55.090
<b>The AI?</b>

16:55.470 --> 16:58.470
<b>She’s more than that.
And we think she’s on our side.</b>

16:59.140 --> 17:02.430
<b>She’ll help take down their servers.
Stall them, if nothing else.</b>

17:10.400 --> 17:11.230
<b>Sarah...</b>

17:12.030 --> 17:16.570
<b>They’ve taken my subject.
Kill the targets. Get her back.</b>

17:20.620 --> 17:21.830
<b>Huh? It’s not--</b>

17:22.450 --> 17:25.290
<b>It seems you’ve made quite a mess.</b>

17:26.460 --> 17:27.370
<b>No!</b>

17:27.790 --> 17:31.380
<b>We have seen you promise and fail.
You’re relieved.</b>

17:31.800 --> 17:33.760
<b>I am still in control. Just give me one--</b>

17:33.840 --> 17:36.220
<b><i>Do not interfere, or you'll be dealt with.</i></b>

17:37.090 --> 17:39.260
<b>Walk away, and do not look back.</b>

17:54.990 --> 17:56.530
<b><i>Get rid of all three of them.</i></b>

17:57.150 --> 17:58.740
<b>Including the subject, sir?</b>

17:59.240 --> 18:02.990
<b>Nonessential. We have what we need.
Just clean things up.</b>

18:03.620 --> 18:04.450
<b><i>Roger that.</i></b>

18:05.080 --> 18:07.790
<b>To our other issue.
Report on your search.</b>

18:08.370 --> 18:10.750
<b>We've surrounded the signal’s origin.
Charges ready.</b>

18:12.170 --> 18:13.000
<b>Take her down.</b>

18:26.560 --> 18:28.350
<b>We need ADA to get a Field up.</b>

18:31.310 --> 18:32.150
<b>What's wrong?</b>

18:35.070 --> 18:36.190
<b>Oh no!</b>

18:37.070 --> 18:37.950
<b>ADA!</b>

18:40.530 --> 18:42.320
<b>This isn’t good. They’re here.</b>

18:44.660 --> 18:45.490
<b>Jack?</b>

18:47.080 --> 18:49.000
<b>We’ll have to make our own luck.</b>

18:57.760 --> 18:59.470
<b>It’s a mess, but salvageable.</b>

19:00.630 --> 19:02.550
<b>Good. Let’s proceed.</b>

19:17.990 --> 19:19.610
<b>Damn. I’m running out of ammo!</b>

19:22.490 --> 19:23.700
<b>I think I have an idea...</b>

19:25.530 --> 19:28.410
<b>I’ll enter the XM substrate to get out.</b>

19:43.300 --> 19:44.970
<b>We’re completely surrounded.</b>

19:51.560 --> 19:52.390
<b>Jack! No!</b>

19:53.020 --> 19:54.980
<b>There is another way out.</b>

19:59.530 --> 20:01.860
<b>If there is, I don’t see it.</b>

20:02.200 --> 20:04.160
<b>This future was always a possibility.</b>

20:04.910 --> 20:07.370
<b>One that I prepared for.</b>

20:07.450 --> 20:08.290
<b>Prepared?</b>

20:12.500 --> 20:16.840
<b>The AR visors. Did you forget
I’m the one who created that tech?</b>

20:17.880 --> 20:21.670
<b>The new Hulong visors contain
Dark XM crystals.</b>

20:23.510 --> 20:25.680
<b>It gives them great power over the mind,</b>

20:25.760 --> 20:28.850
<b>but makes people unstable. And dangerous.</b>

20:29.260 --> 20:33.770
<b>Everyone I’ve worked with has
used my science to aid their cause.</b>

20:34.940 --> 20:37.270
<b>It used to bother me, but no longer.</b>

20:37.360 --> 20:40.110
<b>Their greed’s given me a chance
to save humanity.</b>

20:40.360 --> 20:43.110
<b>But you’re dead! Aren't you?</b>

20:43.200 --> 20:46.240
<b>The flesh is temporary, the soul eternal.</b>

20:46.320 --> 20:49.950
<b>As long as the soul exists,
the flesh will rise once again.</b>

20:50.200 --> 20:51.200
<b>Recursion...</b>

20:51.500 --> 20:54.790
<b>Just one of XM’s many secrets.</b>

20:54.870 --> 20:57.500
<b>One that I used to my advantage
outside of Abaddon.</b>

20:57.750 --> 20:59.000
<b>Don’t leave! Don’t leave!</b>

20:59.380 --> 21:03.420
<b>Trust me. Trust yourself.
Our shared journey is just beginning.</b>

22:53.870 --> 22:55.870
<b>Subtitle Translation by Rika Takahashi</b>
